{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54577","headline":"兵要望江南 占雾第五（京本列第八○十首） 七 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占雾第五（京本列第八○十首） 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"军营内，大雾数朝浓（首本作「昏」，从辛本、川本、京本改）。\n昼夜不开相对敌，客军先败走奔冲，排阵（辛本、川本、京本作「队」）袭其踪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54577.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54577","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}